  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Code Your Rule\r\n\r\n1. Upload your flowchart from Level 9. You may upload your flowchart or describe your rule to AI Chat to plan and debug your code.\r\n\r\n1. Use the same two conditions from your flowchart. Store each as a true/false value (for example, if a checkbox is checked).\r\n\r\n1. Open the `runRule()` function in `script.js`. Write your decision rule there using `if/else` statements with AND and OR operators. Each branch should match one of the outcomes from your truth table.\r\n\r\n1. Update the result area so the correct message or image appears for each outcome.\r\n\r\n1. Run all four combinations (TT, TF, FT, FF). Compare your app's behavior to your truth table and fix anything that doesn't match.\r\n\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "tutor",
    "predict_settings": {
